compareTo()
It is the Abstract method present inside comparable interface

syntax :-     public int compareTo(Object o);

It is used to compare two objects and decide sorting order
compareTo() is mainly used in Treset and sorting collection
return values of compareTo are    
   0  when object are equal
  +ve  current object is greater
  -ve when current object is smaller

sorting is an assending order by defaault 
compareTo()  overriden inside all wraperclass and also in the string class
